  "implementation": [
    "Independent private default-false gates for Favorites, queue and playlist details; no production providers. Existing real rows, bounded measured grids, retention and complete virtual reorder geometry are reused.",
    "Parent/lazy-grid semantic regions use favorites:*, queue:* and playlist:<id>:*. Existing collection navigation, editing owner, filtering, selection, numbering, current-item projection and mutation actions remain authoritative.",
    "C14 playlist overview, Studio C03-C05, shared measurement/motion, storage, transport, native authority and runtime startup are outside this batch."
  ],
